# Auth domain

- Doc: `docs/modules/auth.md`
- Agent: `/tableflow-auth`
- Own: `AuthService`, identity helpers, `authGuard`, login, `registro-empresa` (signup / pendiente / activar)
- Post-signup ADMIN checklist → `/tableflow-onboarding`; staff Edge create-user → `/tableflow-users`
- Do not change 12h session policy, Auth providers, or role semantics without authorization
- Tests: `auth.service.spec.ts`, `auth.guard.spec.ts`, `auth-redirect.spec.ts`
